00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:20.600
the 20-day average and RSI moving from neutral towards 60 on the daily chart. Place a stop 6%

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:27.700
below Friday's close. The target is plus 3% to plus 6% over the five-day hold. Confidence is

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:34.120
